abstract: >-
  A build-along exposition in which every claim is asserted by a test, every
  printed transcript is checked byte-for-byte against its artifact, and a
  SHA-256 certificate records the whole tree. Includes 24 chapters, four
  appendices, 442 passing checks, 151 checked transcripts, and a claims ledger
  labeling every public number MEASURED, MODELED, or RESEARCH DEMO.
notes: >-
  Drafting was AI-assisted within the author's research program (OpenCode);
  all measurements were executed and verified by the author's pipeline. Chapter
  19 is a research demo and makes no clinical claim.
